# From the Batch picker (Batch tab) with the album list closed (R3-c, S23): open the album list, scroll to
# 「Casebook」 (alphabetical, below the digit-named albums; names are not in the page source, so the list is dragged
# three times and the row tapped by position — check with a screenshot if the album count changes), pick ① ② ③ ④
# in that order, Next. Ends on Batch Edit Room main screen with ① current.
tap 300 284
fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700 15
fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700 15
fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700 15
fingerdrag 600 1650 600 700 15
tap 450 817
waitfor "Casebook" --timeout 5
tap 194 686
tap 540 686
tap 885 686
tap 194 1031
expect (4/20)
lbl Next
waitfor "Crop & Rotate" --timeout 15
